Rebased 2026-07-22 onto pjin-nvidia/nv-openhands@ebdc8bc4 (swe-parity-port):
the client's fields_to_remove/provider_specific_fields context changed upstream
(latency metrics + token-id guard); message.py and conversation_memory.py hunks
unchanged. Threads policy_epoch/kv_cache_epoch/num_evictions through the
conversation history so NeMoGym's *ForTraining schema validates on every
assistant turn.

